{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2024-04", "window": 2, "start_date": 1712534400, "end_date": 1713225599, "month_true_total": 131, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:23:21 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "162942884", "author": {"steamid": "76561198255950705", "personaname": "Mexican Meatball", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Mexican_Meatball/", "num_games_owned": 270, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 1759, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1759, "last_played": 1713204127, "avatar": "903bbb623804fcb6ec0a1f1181899ed6aa36698b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Decent game, at least the campaign - 7/10.\n\nLevels and enemies are nicely designed and there is enough action and challenge to stay interesting. Take your time to look around. The main lobby on the other hand feels a bit lazy where people have no animations for talking, barely any dialogue and textures are quite poor in general. \n\nPrepare to grind a bit before you can play at the desired level, they say you need a rating of 500 to play the 'intended' difficulty (intense), meaning you just die on mission one until you reach the approximate rating. After that is decently hard but fair. Harder difficulties is like hitting a wall.\n\nAlternative game modes, I feel, do not add much to the game other than some filler. Same with some weapon types. Snipers are basically useless most of the game and offer no trade-off damage wise for their poor fire-rate / difficulty. \n\nAlso the radio operator is VERY annoying and I'd love for her to just stfu most of the game. \n\nPick it up on sale.\n\n\n\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1713204672, "timestamp_updated": 1713204984, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 47, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.750559985637664795", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "162912040", "author": {"steamid": "76561198121872240", "personaname": "Solamandr501", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Solamandr501/", "num_games_owned": 188, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1905, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 891, "last_played": 1750834735, "avatar": "49b8fc0f64109308009c25636336670ba7d6066e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I am in love with this game. I have played here and on console, and I do not regret spending the money on it. The game is beautiful, has a lot of replayability, is a stunning addition to the franchise, and finally allows you to live out your colonial marine dreams. If you're a fan of the franchise or new to it, I definitely recommend picking this game up.", "timestamp_created": 1713156277, "timestamp_updated": 1713156277, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "162903348", "author": {"steamid": "76561198051145994", "personaname": "TimHortonHAW", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198051145994/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 158, "playtime_forever": 3965, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3965, "last_played": 1660116451, "avatar": "2f770bea9938a070c35c79b4abbaba730118bf4a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bought the Season pass.\r\nThey released an expansion after the season pass expired.\r\nWill never give these scum bags money ever again and I tell everyone to stay away.\r\nGood job devs.", "timestamp_created